+.. rst:directive:: .. py:type:: name
+
+   Describes a type alias. The optional ``canonical`` option gives the
+   alias expression, which is parsed as a Python type annotation. Type aliases
+   may be documented at module level or inside a class.
+
+   .. code-block:: rst
+
+      .. py:type:: UserId
